WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.281 --> 00:00:01.654
Aur sabse interesting cheez

2
00:00:01.674 --> 00:00:03.508
... Wisdom teeth. Tumhare

3
00:00:03.839 --> 00:00:04.801
muh ke sabse peeche

4
00:00:04.821 --> 00:00:06.010
wale chaar daant. Jo

5
00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:08.007
aksar satrah se pachees

6
00:00:08.027 --> 00:00:08.884
saal ki umar mein

7
00:00:08.904 --> 00:00:09.948
aate hain. Aur aksar

8
00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:11.556
dard karte hain, tedhe

9
00:00:11.576 --> 00:00:13.615
aate hain, ya nikalwane

10
00:00:13.635 --> 00:00:15.067
padte hain. Kyun?

